        "paragraph_id": "747713BA",
        "text": "(2.73)"
      },
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 27683,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 778,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 686,
        "paragraph_id": "0FB12221",
        "text": "If wave stirring is turned off (keyword: lws = 0), the velocity magnitude will be determined by two terms: first of all a factor of the velocity magnitude of the previous time step (vmgn-1) and secondly a current-averaged part. Averaging will be carried out based on a certain factor fcats (keyword: cats. Default value is 4.0) of the representative wave period Trep."
      }
    ],
    "following_nonempty_paragraphs": [
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 27872,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 782,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 690,
        "paragraph_id": "76C5EC5A",
        "text": "Trep is the representative wave period and Ew is the energy of the wave. Trep is equal to Tm01 by default using keyword Tm01switch=1, and becomes Tm-1,0 for Tm01switch=0."
      },
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 28000,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 784,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 692,
        "paragraph_id": "0353DA3D",
        "text": "Secondly, the root-mean-squared velocity, the urms is obtained from the wave group varying wave energy using linear wave theory. In this formulation Trep is the representative wave period and the Hrms is the root-mean-square wave height. In this equation the water depth is enhanced with a certain factor of the wave height (keyword: delta, see equation 2.11)."
      }
    ],
    "table_cell": null,
    "text_method": "Saved display-field substitution plus w:t; equation objects are not transcribed."
  },
